# ethren (S5): the helmet overlays (art/sprites/overlays.json "helmets") and whether each is closed (DCC/Looks.h).
# Rows by the helmet's 2-letter animation code (ITM 0x22). An open helmet draws the hair's crop at its rim
# (dcchair.2da HELMET); a closed one covers the head down to the neck, so the open crop would poke out of it:
# it draws the hair's CLOSED crop instead. S7: a hood (RH, the Ranger outfit's cloth hood with its mantle) covers all the
# hair and leaves the face bare: no hair is drawn under it and a beard is drawn whole (its own CODE).
# CLOSED 1: closed, 0: open, 2: a hood; a helmet not listed is open.
      CLOSED
LC    0
KH    0
NH    0
FH    1
RH    2
